# Excluded from Workers Static Assets.
# The LibreOffice blobs are served from R2 by the Worker (see `run_worker_first`
# in wrangler.toml); the compression sidecars and source maps are redundant
# because Cloudflare compresses on the fly. This also keeps a local
# `wrangler deploy` from tripping the 25 MiB per-asset limit.
libreoffice-wasm/
*.br
*.gz
*.map
